## End-to-End Workflow

``` text
User
 ↓
Text / Voice
 ↓
Speech-to-Text (if voice)
 ↓
Query Filtering
 ↓
Language Detection
 ↓
Product Identification
 ↓
Intent Detection
 ↓
Retrieval Query Generation
 ↓
Qdrant Search
 ↓
Relevant BIS Context
 ↓
Groq LLM
 ↓
Final Answer
 ↓
Text / TTS Voice
```

