# Authentication Backend

The Express backend is:

``` text
sihFrontend/server/
```

It provides:

-   Signup
-   Login
-   Current-user endpoint
-   JWT authentication
-   Password hashing
-   MongoDB persistence
-   CORS
-   FastAPI proxy routes

Current authentication endpoints:

``` text
POST /api/auth/signup
POST /api/auth/login
GET  /api/auth/me
```

Passwords are hashed with bcrypt before being stored.

