# API Reference

## FastAPI

### Health

``` http
GET /health
```

### Query

``` http
POST /query
Content-Type: application/json
```

Body:

``` json
{
  "query": "What is the BIS standard for a domestic pressure cooker?"
}
```

### Transcribe

``` http
POST /transcribe
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
```

Form field:

``` text
audio=<audio file>
```

### Speak

``` http
POST /speak
Content-Type: application/json
```

Body:

``` json
{
  "text": "Welcome to Jagruk Brain."
}
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Express Proxy API

The Express server proxies AI operations to FastAPI:

``` text
POST /api/query
      ↓
FastAPI /query

POST /api/transcribe
      ↓
FastAPI /transcribe

POST /api/speak
      ↓
FastAPI /speak
```

Authentication routes:

``` text
POST /api/auth/signup
POST /api/auth/login
GET  /api/auth/me
```

Health:

``` text
GET /api/health
```

